# TajStay shells architecture (requirements freeze)

One **TajStay Product System** (shared tokens, type, radius, buttons, badges, charts).
Three **modes** with different IA — not three random UIs.

```text
TajStay
├── Public Desktop — hotels, tours, search, marketing (+ website footer OK)
├── Consumer Mobile — Главная · Поиск · Туры · История · Профиль
├── Owner Workspace — Обзор · Отели · Номера · Брони · Аналитика · Ещё
└── Admin Workspace — Обзор · Заявки · Пользователи · Бронирования · Ещё
```

Desktop Owner/Admin → sidebar; mobile → bottom nav. **Do not** show consumer tabs in Admin/Owner.

**Do not** redesign pages one-by-one until MASTER BLOCK / P0 foundation. Screenshots enlarge **baseline evidence**, not a queue of isolated CSS patches. Prefer polish **after** security + data + contrast shells.

## Priority (updated — security/data above polish)

### 🔴 P0 SECURITY
1. Investigate/remove unsafe default **secret word** model (UI leak alone is not a fix).
2. **Owner Access:** forbid admin inventing/setting owner working passwords; only secure recovery initiation.
3. Owner phone/email change = separate confirmed flows + Audit Log + owner security notification — not inline CRM text fields.
4. Backend AuthZ for critical ops (roles, ban, moderation, security updates, credentials).
5. Split email / phone / password into separate verified flows — no mono «Сохранить безопасность».
6. Protect role change / blocking / hotel moderation (confirm + reason).
7. **Audit Log** for admin mutations (incl. owner access + complaint resolution).
8. Do not architect forever as `if role === ADMIN → allow all` — leave room for Super Admin / Ops / Moderator / Support / Finance.

### 🔴 P0 DATA / RUNTIME
9. Investigate finance outlier amounts (e.g. `1081500` TJS) — real vs test vs unit bug.
10. KPI breakdowns must cover **100%** of the sample (no silent remainder).
11. Forbid blank white panel / dead-end empty chrome — diagnose: no data vs crash vs off-viewport vs **invisible via contrast**.
12. State matrix on every data-driven route: loading · content · empty · error · 401/403 · offline · partial.
13. Recurring Admin **500**: reproduce exact user action → request → endpoint → log → exception (do not only restyle `/500`).
14. Scrub demo/fake values in production UI/DB (e.g. repeated `owner@example.com` if stored as real data; empty → «Email не указан»).

### 🔴 P0 UI FOUNDATION
15. Semantic colors/contrast (systemic — not `.page { color }`).
16. Full Admin UI localization (ru primary) via presentation maps — no raw enums.
17. Separate Admin / Consumer / Owner shells; no marketing footer under mobile workspace nav.
18. Readable Admin bottom nav; More drawer as proper mobile sheet.
19. Strip internal strings: `MEDIUM`, `needs moderation`, `PENDING`, `CAPTURED`, `MANUAL/DC`, etc.

### 🟠 P1
Complaint **case** management · Hotel moderation workflow · Finance CRM · CMS draft/preview/publish · Admin action queues · User / Owner Access list→detail · Assistant · Profile grouped lists · coarse permission roles.

### ⚪ P2
Motion, advanced charts, premium gold, richer imagery.

## Hard layout rules

- Admin/Owner mobile: bottom nav = **last** chrome; no `site-footer` / © under it.
- Admin header: `[TajStay] … [☰]`; drawer = secondary tools (not duplicate of primary five).
- Errors use **mode shell**; do not collapse all failures into marketing fullscreen 500.
- Canonical brand spelling: **TajStay** (not Tajstay / TAJSTAY / Taj Stay unless intentional marketing art).

## Semantic color (contrast) — systemic only

```text
text-primary | text-secondary | text-tertiary | text-disabled | text-on-brand
icon-primary | icon-secondary | icon-disabled
surface-page | surface-card | surface-brand | surface-selected | surface-disabled
```

**Forbidden:** local contrast patches; deriving readable text from brand green / mint `#d8f1e2`.

## Admin Overview

- KPI visuals must account for full distribution (bookings remainder; hotel: approved / in review / rejected / blocked as applicable).
- Keep **Требует внимания** → evolve into **action queues** (applications, moderation, support, payment issues) with deep links.

## Localization / presentation mapping

All backend enums/statuses/risk reasons/payment methods go through i18n maps before UI.
Admin UI must not show raw English technical values in production.

## Hotel moderation

Detail-first workflow (photos, map, owner, history, risk reasons) → Approve / Request info / Reject(+reason).
Risk score = **moderator signal only** — not auto-reject if heuristic.

## CMS (homepage content)

Prefer Draft → Preview (desktop + mobile) → Publish.
Validate CTA URLs (https / internal routes; block `javascript:` and open-redirect abuse).

## Finance

Human labels for status/method; locale money formatter; immutable-ish ledger + audit; anomaly flags for outliers.
P1 KPI set: turnover, received, pending, refunds, commission, payable, paid.

## Complaints (case management — P1 UX, P0 if PII/auth gaps)

List = compact summary (no unnecessary full phones in list). Detail case view requires:
complaint ID · reporter · target · booking · category · created · status · priority · assignee · attachments · resolution history.
Close requires **reason + who + when** — status «РЕШЕНО» alone is insufficient.
User/hotel free text may stay in source language; **all Admin chrome/statuses/filters/errors = Russian**.

## Owner Access (P0 SECURITY)

- **Forbidden:** admin sets owner password as a CRM field.
- **Allowed:** «Отправить восстановление доступа» → one-time short-lived token (hashed at rest), invalidate previous tokens, no token in logs, rate limit, Audit Log, invalidate sessions after success / critical change.
- Phone/email: detail flows with permission check, previous value retained in audit, notify owner.
- List UX: compact rows → «Управление доступом ›» sheet (contacts · recovery · sessions · history) — not full forms on every card.
- CODE today: `/api/admin/users/credentials` updates phone/email + deletes sessions (no audit/reason/notify); reset uses hashed token + 1h expiry + httpOnly cookie handoff (`reset-password/route.ts`) but MASTER must still verify single-use, prior-token invalidation, rate limits, audit, and UI that still exposes reset link + placeholder `owner@example.com`.

## State matrix (all data UIs)

| State | User sees |
| --- | --- |
| Loading | skeleton/progress |
| Success + data | content |
| Success + empty | real empty state |
| 4xx / 401/403 | clear access message |
| 5xx | retry + correlation id |
| Offline | network message |
| Partial | working part + local error |

**Forbidden:** huge blank white rectangle with no explanation.
When blank repeats: inspect DOM — missing data vs thrown error vs off-canvas drawer vs content present but **white-on-white** (extreme contrast FAIL).

